			(property "Description" "Microchip 93LC46BT-I/SN, FTDI EEPROM (USB VID/PID/descriptors)   64 x 16 = 1 Kbit. DS_FT2232H p27: \"The EEPROM should be a 16 bit wide configuration such as a Microchip 93LC46B or equivalent capable of a 1 Mbit/s clock rate at VCC = +3.00 V to 3.6 V.\" The B suffix is the fixed x16 organisation, so pins 6 and 7 are both no-connect; only the selectable C variant puts ORG on pin 6."
				(at 0 0 0)
				(show_name no)
