		(property "NOTE" "Stays 0402 deliberately. Power is trivial (0.9 mW) and 1 percent is 1 percent at any size, but this is the FT2232's RREF -- it sets the USB transceiver bias current. There is no space pressure on this board any more, so there is nothing to gain against a part whose drift shows up as USB signal quality."
