		(property "NOTE" "FT2232H core-rail decoupling. DS_FT2232H Figures 4.1 and 6.1 show a 100 nF at each VCORE pin besides the 4.7 uF bulk (C39, C139); the board had the bulk and none of these. Same part as the eight 0.1 uF and 100 nF 0201 capacitors already on this sheet, so no new BOM line. AT LAYOUT: put one beside each of pins 12, 37 and 64 with the shortest ground return you can manage -- that placement is the whole point of them."
			(at 0 314.706 0)
			(hide yes)
			(show_name no)
