		(property "NOTE" "Bare plated holes -- NO HEADER FITTED, nothing to order. Three of the six JTAG holes; JP3 carries the other three, 17.96 mm away on the far side of the Pmod. Each row has 3.05 mm of board to the Pmod but only 0.09 mm to a 1x3 strip's body, so these are for flying leads or a pogo jig. The FT2232 does JTAG over USB on channel B; this is the fallback."
			(at 0 314.706 90)
			(hide yes)
